// =============================================================================
// BuildingUpgradeRouter (WO-430) — dispatch a building's Talk to its 4-tier upgrade
// tree by $structureId (set by DialogueService.PlayStructure). Jump here from the
// StructureMenu "Upgrade" option (final wiring step) or the dev menu. Additive —
// touches no existing node. Non-WO-430 structures fall through to a polite no-op.
// =============================================================================
title: BuildingUpgradeRouter
tags: structure upgrade router
---
<<if $structureId == "arcane-tower">>
    <<jump ArcaneTower_Upgrade>>
<<elseif $structureId == "armorer">>
    <<jump Armorer_Upgrade>>
<<elseif $structureId == "forge">>
    <<jump Forge_Upgrade>>
<<elseif $structureId == "lumbermill">>
    <<jump Lumbermill_Upgrade>>
<<elseif $structureId == "windmill">>
    <<jump Windmill_Upgrade>>
<<else>>
    There is nothing to upgrade here.
<<endif>>
===
